1
00:00:00,324 --> 00:00:03,454
(Raj:)-I'm not going to punch you.
-That's what my sister used to say.

2
00:00:04,787 --> 00:00:07,957
-Look, do you wanna do this or not?
-I'm sorry. Proceed.

3
00:00:08,123 --> 00:00:09,793
All right, ahem...

4
00:00:09,959 --> 00:00:13,839
(Raj:)...imagine yourself in the one place
you feel most at home.

5
00:00:14,046 --> 00:00:17,636
(Raj:)-Where is that?
-SimCity.

6
00:00:19,426 --> 00:00:24,596
More specifically, the SimCity
I designed, Sheldonopolis.

7
00:00:25,349 --> 00:00:27,139
(Raj:)Okay, you're in Sheldonopolis.

8
00:00:27,309 --> 00:00:29,769
(Sheldon:)Where exactly? Sheldon Square?

9
00:00:29,937 --> 00:00:34,567
(Sheldon:)Sheldon Towers? Sheldon Stadium,
home of the fighting Sheldons?

10
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:36,150
(Raj:)Whatever you like.

11
00:00:36,318 --> 00:00:38,858
(Sheldon:)I thought this was supposed to be
guided meditation.

12
00:00:39,071 --> 00:00:41,701
(Raj:)Fine, you're in Sheldon Square.

13
00:00:41,865 --> 00:00:44,205
Really? This time of the year?
It's a bit nippy.

14
00:00:44,994 --> 00:00:46,324
(Raj:)Then put on a sweater.

15
00:00:46,870 --> 00:00:51,000
(Sheldon:)Suppose I could run downtown
and pick up something at Shel-Mart.

16
00:00:51,834 --> 00:00:53,624
(Raj:)Yeah. Whatever.
Just go buy a sweater.

17
00:00:53,794 --> 00:00:59,024
(Sheldon:)The nice thing about Shel-Mart is
I own it, so I get a 15 percent discount.

